{"3844300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Frame of Suffering", "steam_appid": 3844300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't know who you are, or why you are here. You just know you were abandoned… you need to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frame of Suffering</strong> is a <strong>dark Sci-Fi ARPG Roguelite</strong> where the path to freedom leads directly into the heart of an Ancient Temple’s shifting depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the secrets buried within, you must master both <strong>Man</strong> and <strong>Machine</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly switch between your customizable Hero and a modifiable Combat Frame, utilizing fast-paced <strong>Action Combat</strong> and a deep <strong>loot</strong> system that evolves the stats and <strong>visual appearance</strong> of both you and your Frame. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/fef3579f2ce574c3bbc616aa3b407387.poster.avif?t=1787565659\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/fef3579f2ce574c3bbc616aa3b407387.webm?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/fef3579f2ce574c3bbc616aa3b407387.mp4?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Progression</strong> - Customize your Hero and Combat Frame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Crafting</strong> - large amount of character implants and Frame attachments (skills) to obtain during gameplay, and items that further can enhance your chosen build/playstyle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix of procedurally generated and hand crafted dungeons and loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite elements</strong> - during your dungeon run you will acquire temporary character and skill upgrades, that can further empower your specific build.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/740e837f89616f65a429f0bb7643f488.poster.avif?t=1787565659\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/740e837f89616f65a429f0bb7643f488.webm?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/740e837f89616f65a429f0bb7643f488.mp4?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Frame</strong> - during your dungeon runs, you can equip your Frame that works almost like a second character, adding new attack capabilities and further increasing build crafting potential. You will also be able to craft or find new parts for your Frame with different stats that also visually change the Frames appearance (arms, legs, torso, and head).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple levels and Unique Boss fights</strong> - on each dungeon level you will find a gatekeeper preventing you from going deeper into the Temple. Each Boss encounter is unique and may require specialised builds to beat them, or you can always use the true and trusted brute force approach. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/0b8f751f8e7b7acf415db61e5f1b33e5.poster.avif?t=1787565659\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/0b8f751f8e7b7acf415db61e5f1b33e5.webm?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/0b8f751f8e7b7acf415db61e5f1b33e5.mp4?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual progression</strong> - Each piece of armor and weapon visually changes the look of your character and your Frame, the deeper into the Temple you go, the more unique and exotic armor and weapons you will find.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/a63d09942e2e5d4347f14614189e44a9.poster.avif?t=1787565659\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/a63d09942e2e5d4347f14614189e44a9.webm?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/a63d09942e2e5d4347f14614189e44a9.mp4?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full inventory, extraction and stash system</strong> - during each dungeon run, you will be able to extract some items that you have found. Items can be later given to the character, stashed away, or simply dismantled for resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich story - discover the truth about the Temple, and unveil your own lost memories while exploring the dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No microtransactions</strong> - Everything in the game is unlocked by gameplay only. There are no paywall blocked cosmetics or features of the game. You pay once and get the game in its entirety, for everything to be discovered and acquired by your effort alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame of Suffering is currently in development. Wishlist now to be notified when the game releases!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't know who you are, or why you are here. You just know you were abandoned… you need to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frame of Suffering</strong> is a <strong>dark Sci-Fi ARPG Roguelite</strong> where the path to freedom leads directly into the heart of an Ancient Temple’s shifting depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the secrets buried within, you must master both <strong>Man</strong> and <strong>Machine</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly switch between your customizable Hero and a modifiable Combat Frame, utilizing fast-paced <strong>Action Combat</strong> and a deep <strong>loot</strong> system that evolves the stats and <strong>visual appearance</strong> of both you and your Frame. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/fef3579f2ce574c3bbc616aa3b407387.poster.avif?t=1787565659\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/fef3579f2ce574c3bbc616aa3b407387.webm?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/fef3579f2ce574c3bbc616aa3b407387.mp4?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dual Progression</strong> - Customize your Hero and Combat Frame</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Crafting</strong> - large amount of character implants and Frame attachments (skills) to obtain during gameplay, and items that further can enhance your chosen build/playstyle.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix of procedurally generated and hand crafted dungeons and loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roguelite elements</strong> - during your dungeon run you will acquire temporary character and skill upgrades, that can further empower your specific build.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/740e837f89616f65a429f0bb7643f488.poster.avif?t=1787565659\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/740e837f89616f65a429f0bb7643f488.webm?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/740e837f89616f65a429f0bb7643f488.mp4?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat Frame</strong> - during your dungeon runs, you can equip your Frame that works almost like a second character, adding new attack capabilities and further increasing build crafting potential. You will also be able to craft or find new parts for your Frame with different stats that also visually change the Frames appearance (arms, legs, torso, and head).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple levels and Unique Boss fights</strong> - on each dungeon level you will find a gatekeeper preventing you from going deeper into the Temple. Each Boss encounter is unique and may require specialised builds to beat them, or you can always use the true and trusted brute force approach. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/0b8f751f8e7b7acf415db61e5f1b33e5.poster.avif?t=1787565659\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/0b8f751f8e7b7acf415db61e5f1b33e5.webm?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/0b8f751f8e7b7acf415db61e5f1b33e5.mp4?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual progression</strong> - Each piece of armor and weapon visually changes the look of your character and your Frame, the deeper into the Temple you go, the more unique and exotic armor and weapons you will find.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/a63d09942e2e5d4347f14614189e44a9.poster.avif?t=1787565659\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/a63d09942e2e5d4347f14614189e44a9.webm?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/extras/a63d09942e2e5d4347f14614189e44a9.mp4?t=1787565659\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full inventory, extraction and stash system</strong> - during each dungeon run, you will be able to extract some items that you have found. Items can be later given to the character, stashed away, or simply dismantled for resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich story - discover the truth about the Temple, and unveil your own lost memories while exploring the dungeon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No microtransactions</strong> - Everything in the game is unlocked by gameplay only. There are no paywall blocked cosmetics or features of the game. You pay once and get the game in its entirety, for everything to be discovered and acquired by your effort alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Frame of Suffering is currently in development. Wishlist now to be notified when the game releases!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Master both man and machine to escape the Ancient Temple. Customize your Hero and a modifiable Combat Frame to slay hordes and gatekeepers. Scavenge tech, uncover the Temple's history, and evolve your build in this Sci-Fi ARPG Roguelite. You're a prisoner - freedom lies at the heart of the Temple.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Polish, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Ukrainian, Simplified Chinese, Italian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/c546a54456775f5d1174190d72582c2519f34956/header.jpg?t=1787565659", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/a551eea6ffcc9978db096c8ae672d575b16a6e16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787565659", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844300/a551eea6ffcc9978db096c8ae672d575b16a6e16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787565659", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core 2.6GHz x86-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 650 Ti or ATI Radeon™ HD 7850<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad core 3.2GHz x64-compatible<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 6 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1050 Ti or ATI Radeon™ R